    "config.MoreWizard.description": "If enabled and Wizard is selected at the Winter Star with Unique Winter Star installed, gives Magnus unique dating and married variants for when he is married to the farmer (Magnus does not have a spicy variant). Disable to remove these dialogue changes and only get Unique Winter Star's (platonic) variant. (Without Unique Winter Star, this setting will do nothing.)",
	"config.MoreWizard.values.enabled": "enabled",
